      "widgets_values": [
        "Create one continuous cinematic shot that begins exactly on the supplied first frame and arrives exactly on the supplied last frame. Treat both endpoint images as hard visual anchors. Preserve the main subject's identity, facial structure, body proportions, clothing, props, environment geometry, lighting direction, materials, and color palette. Plan a smooth, physically plausible progression between the endpoints with coherent body motion, object motion, camera path, focus changes, and temporal continuity. No unintended cuts, no duplicate subjects, no identity drift, no sudden morphing, no disappearing objects, and no frozen intermediate frames. Audio: generate native stereo ambience, synchronized Foley and sound effects that follow the visible action; include dialogue, voice, or music only when explicitly described here."
      ],
